<section class="nb-cell nb-cell--markdown"><div class="nb-markdown"><div>

  
  <div>
    MODULE 3 SUPPLEMENT: DIAGNOSING LINE ASSUMPTION VIOLATIONS
  </div>

  
  <div>
    <span>
      DS211: LINEAR AND NONLINEAR MODELS
    </span>
  </div>

  
