</div></section>
<section class="nb-cell nb-cell--markdown"><div class="nb-markdown"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Letter</th>
<th>Right Tool</th>
<th>Violation Signature</th>
<th>Satisfied Looks Like</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td><strong>L</strong> – Linearity</td>
<td>Residuals vs. Fitted (not raw scatterplot)</td>
<td>Curve, U-shape, or wave in the residuals</td>
<td>Random cloud, no shape, centered on zero</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>I</strong> – Independence</td>
<td>Residuals vs. Order (+ Durbin-Watson)</td>
<td>Runs/streaks, drift, or repeating rhythm over order</td>
