</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>N</strong> – Normality</td>
<td>Q-Q Plot (+ test/skew-kurtosis, scaled to sample size)</td>
<td>Points bending away from the diagonal at one or both ends</td>
<td>Points hugging the 45° line end to end</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>E</strong> – Equal Variance</td>
<td>Residuals vs. Fitted (spread, not shape)</td>
